title: Sponsors
---
sidebar: no
---
body:

Psycopg is free software, maintained thanks to the generosity of the companies
and individuals listed below. Thank you for supporting the ongoing development
of Psycopg 3, Psycopg 2, and the related tools!

Sponsorship tiers and their perks are described on our `GitHub Sponsors
page`__. Every contribution, large or small, helps keep the project healthy.

.. __: https://github.com/sponsors/psycopg
